# Windows / WSL Shell (mandatory)

This repo lives under a **Chinese Windows path**. Cursor Shell is **PowerShell**. Violating either fact causes flaky WSL launches.

## Canonical paths (use these only)

| Role | Path |
|------|------|
| Windows ASCII junction | `C:\dev\Android_SMS_Classifier` |
| WSL working copy | `/home/colab/projects/Android_SMS_Classifier` |
| Distro | `Ubuntu-22.04` |

Never put `oppo的项目` or any non-ASCII path into a `wsl` command line or into `/mnt/c/...` arguments.

## How to run bash from the agent

1. Write a `.sh` (or `.py`) file under the repo (Write tool is fine).
2. Launch **only** via the launcher (no inline bash body on the PowerShell line):

```powershell
powershell -NoProfile -File C:\dev\Android_SMS_Classifier\tools\wsl_run.ps1 -RelPath training\scripts\foo.sh
```

The launcher copies the script into the WSL ASCII tree and runs it there.

## Forbidden patterns

- `wsl ... bash -lc "...$HOME..."` / any `$` on the PowerShell-facing `wsl` command (PowerShell eats `$`)
- `wsl ... /mnt/c/Users/.../oppo的项目/...`
- Long inline bash pasted into `wsl -- bash -lc '...'`

## Allowed short WSL probes (no `$`, ASCII only)

```powershell
wsl -d Ubuntu-22.04 -- bash /home/colab/projects/Android_SMS_Classifier/training/scripts/foo.sh
wsl -d Ubuntu-22.04 -e /home/colab/.local/bin/colab version
```

## Android / Gradle

Prefer `cd C:\dev\Android_SMS_Classifier\android` before `gradlew`.
